{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgotten Signal: Portal</strong><br>A first-person shooter (FPS) and third-person shooter (TPS) game that blends horror, mystery, and action. Designed for 1-4 player co-op gameplay, each character in this game has unique abilities, and your goal is to use these abilities strategically to defeat the main enemy through a portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABILITY SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1-Enemy Detection</strong>: When this ability is activated, the enemy's location is revealed. You can see if an enemy is approaching or pinpoint their position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2-Invisibility</strong>: This ability allows you to become invisible, making it impossible for enemies to detect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3-Healing</strong>: Using this ability, you can heal your teammates within a specific area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4-Stasis</strong>: This ability lets you stop enemies in their tracks, rendering them immobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594790?t=1752873391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/5ed6046477d2ea453ee7bc8cb267916000e78843/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752873391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/6f2d759ba6de4bb2024eb9dcf29c88f7f9a5307a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752873391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594790/6f2d759ba6de4bb2024eb9dcf29c88f7f9a5307a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752873391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id"